/T (This project presents the design, implementation, and evaluation of a real-time moving object detection and trajectory tracking system using classical computer vision techniques in Python with OpenCV. The system utilizes the CSRT \(Discriminative Correlation Filter with Channel and Spatial Reliability\) tracker, a robust tracking algorithm capable of handling scale variation, occlusion, and background noise in dynamic environments such as traffic surveillance videos.)
/E (This project presents the design, implementation, and evaluation of a real-time moving object detection and trajectory tracking system using classical computer vision techniques in Python with OpenCV. The system utilizes the CSRT \(Discriminative Correlation Filter with Channel and Spatial Reliability\) tracker, a robust tracking algorithm capable of handling scale variation, occlusion, and background noise in dynamic environments such as traffic surveillance videos.)
