/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 137 0 R
/T (The proposed pipeline begins with a preprocessing stage that applies multiple image enhancement techniques, including frame resizing, Gaussian denoising, grayscale conversion, and histogram equalization. These operations improve visual clarity and tracking stability under varying lighting conditions, motion blur, and noise commonly found in real-world video streams. The core tracking module initializes a bounding box around a selected object in the video frame. The CSRT tracker then continuously updates the object position across successive frames by learning correlation filters and spatial reliability maps. Unlike detection-based systems, this approach does not require a pre-trained dataset and operates efficiently on standard CPU hardware.)
/E (The proposed pipeline begins with a preprocessing stage that applies multiple image enhancement techniques, including frame resizing, Gaussian denoising, grayscale conversion, and histogram equalization. These operations improve visual clarity and tracking stability under varying lighting conditions, motion blur, and noise commonly found in real-world video streams. The core tracking module initializes a bounding box around a selected object in the video frame. The CSRT tracker then continuously updates the object position across successive frames by learning correlation filters and spatial reliability maps. Unlike detection-based systems, this approach does not require a pre-trained dataset and operates efficiently on standard CPU hardware.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
