/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 152 0 R
/T (This project designed, implemented, and evaluated a real-time moving object detection and trajectory tracking system using the CSRT algorithm. The system enables accurate object localization and motion analysis through a lightweight, CPU-efficient pipeline, demonstrating reliable performance without requiring deep learning models, labelled datasets, or specialized hardware.)
/E (This project designed, implemented, and evaluated a real-time moving object detection and trajectory tracking system using the CSRT algorithm. The system enables accurate object localization and motion analysis through a lightweight, CPU-efficient pipeline, demonstrating reliable performance without requiring deep learning models, labelled datasets, or specialized hardware.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
