/Title (To analyze object motion, the system computes the centroid of the bounding box in each frame and records its position over time. These points are used to generate a trajectory path visualization, which provides insight into movement patterns such as direction, displacement, and motion consistency. The trajectory is dynamically updated and displayed along with the tracking output.)
