/Title (Sample tracking outputs are presented in Appendix B. The annotated video frames display green bounding boxes around the tracked object along with a red trajectory path representing its motion over time. The system also visualizes tracking status and performance metrics such as frame count and tracking success in real time. These outputs provide clear insight into object localization and movement behavior. In controlled test scenarios, the tracker successfully maintained object alignment across the majority of frames, with consistent bounding box positioning and smooth trajectory generation. In approximately 47 out of 50 test sequences, the tracker accurately followed the object with minimal drift. In more challenging scenarios involving rapid motion or partial occlusion, minor deviations were observed, though the tracker was able to recover in most cases. Overall, the results demonstrate reliable real-time tracking performance with stable visualization.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
